    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Charles returns six months after his first visit. He has had no opioid or other drug use and no cravings. His mood is good, and he answered the PHQ-9 aloud today with a score of 2, with no thoughts of suicide or self-harm. His eyes have been comfortable. He has had no falls. The naloxone sprays are in date. He finished the written plan for any future pain with Dr. Fenwick today and has it saved on his phone. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Recovery</td><td>Sustained remission; no cravings</td></tr><tr><td>Mood</td><td>PHQ-9 2; item 9 scored 0</td></tr><tr><td>Pain plan</td><td>Finished and saved on his phone</td></tr><tr><td>Falls</td><td>None in six months</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

